{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Take care of [Eb]him
And what[F]ever more you spend
I will re[Bb]pay [F/A]you [Gm]when I re[Eb]turn
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[F]Go and do like[Bb]wise
{end_of_verse}
